  "2026-11-09T00:40:18.559Z",codex-agent,"Final class closure: PRRT_kwDOTwgMRs61Cfjp was already addressed by 28d7398 and is re-proved through both signals on all nine runners; nested process groups and restoring runner ownership now cover PRRT_kwDOTwgMRs61FGg1. Atomic Windows kernel job ownership and retained exit/pipe ownership cover PRRT_kwDOTwgMRs61FGg6. Shared Unix-only proof selection covers both PRRT_kwDOTwgMRs61E7rv and PRRT_kwDOTwgMRs61FGhA. Structured unavailable timing receipts cover PRRT_kwDOTwgMRs61FGg-. Generic JSON item-error warning retention and injectable diagnostic streams cover PRRT_kwDOTwgMRs61FGhE. Protected declaration strings/collections, public delivery guards and pinned terminal receipt measurements cover PRRT_kwDOTwgMRs61FGhM. All findings are addressed; no review thread was replied to, resolved or reacted to."
